<title>CHINA: Daiwa Associate yr profit down 76 pct.</title>
<headline>Daiwa Associate yr profit down 76 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   1.4    vs 7.6 (adjusted)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil    vs 2.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    3.88   vs 16.05</p>
<p>    Turnover		     531.59 vs 578.78</p>
<p>    Company name		 Daiwa Associate Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 15-19</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Daiwa Associate is an electronic components manufacturer.</p>
<p>Comparative share earnings have been adjusted for the one-for-two rights issue in 1997.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs four H.K. cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6368</p>
